OL,3,AResidents lodge fresh legal bid to stop
OL,4,ADrumcree march
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawyers for the Garvaghy Road Residents
OL,7,FCoalition have issued a fresh legal bid
OL,8,Fto try to prevent the controversial
OL,9,FDrumcree march from going ahead.
OL,11,FMembers of the Orange Order are still
OL,12,Fwaiting to begin their permitted
OL,13,Fparade, which was due to take place on
OL,14,FSunday, and walk down the mainly
OL,15,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road in Portadown.
OL,17,FProtesters remain along the Garvaghy
OL,18,FRoad but the Orangemen who had been at
OL,19,FDrumcree church since Sunday morning
OL,20,Fleft during the night.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
